{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"","kicker_size":3,"show_title":true,"title_size":8,"show_content":true,"content_size":5,"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"BOLSAS Y EMPAQUES","text_size":8}},"template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Entregamos y enviamos tus compras en empaques reutilizables, reciclables y compostables.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-heading-1","template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"BOLSAS DE PAPEL","title":"","text":"<p>Nuestras bolsas de papel son fabricadas en Chile, cuentan con la certificación FSC (manejo sostenible de bosques) y están impresas con tintas a base de agua.<\/p><p>Desde la implementación de nuestro plan \"menos bolsas\" en junio de 2022 y gracias al compromiso de todo el equipo y de nuestros clientes, hemos logrado reducir la entrega de bolsas de papel en nuestras tiendas en un 42%, lo que nos ayuda a reducir el uso de empaques de un solo uso.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SIN_BOLSA.webp","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-text-1","template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-image-1"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_third","brick_gutter":50,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9cdc6a1f-879f-455f-9bff-e052882be2cf":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"template--16975539273940__9cdc6a1f-879f-455f-9bff-e052882be2cf-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Si de todos modos decides pedir tu bolsa Froens de papel, ya sea para un regalo u otro motivo, recuerda que son 100% reciclables!<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":6,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["template--16975539273940__9cdc6a1f-879f-455f-9bff-e052882be2cf-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"5145f454-0a4e-4f1d-8d86-a6540493deff":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"fd872a9a-4b1f-4340-a378-251eb8ea8db2":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"BOLSAS COMPOSTABLES","title":"","text":"<p>Para los envíos de compras online, utilizamos bolsas compostables certificadas, fabricadas a partir de un biopolímero que se obtiene del almidón de maíz (PLA). Estas bolsas pueden ser compostadas de manera industrial a través de empresas que se dediquen a procesar estos materiales y también pueden ser compostadas en compostera casera. En este último caso y bajo su correcto manejo, la bolsa se degradará en un plazo entre 60 y 90 días.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"db7e82b2-e051-4844-8cce-4a1d926b8d66":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/COMPOSTABLES.webp","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["fd872a9a-4b1f-4340-a378-251eb8ea8db2","db7e82b2-e051-4844-8cce-4a1d926b8d66"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_third","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"6e57cd6e-dc2c-49d8-94ec-b9bba1c8a53c":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"95f0ac93-835c-4306-8c23-d9585c2f9d8e":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Pero, ¿qué pasa si no tienes cómo compostar tu bolsa? ¡Nosotros lo hacemos por ti! Puedes acercarte a cualquiera de nuestras tiendas y traer tu bolsa Froens compostable y nosotros la gestionaremos.<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":6,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["95f0ac93-835c-4306-8c23-d9585c2f9d8e"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"f3bd1fad-2688-4827-a97b-25006255454b":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"da845415-d463-490d-88a5-41644a90748d":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"BOLSAS REUTILIZABLES","title":"","text":"<p>Nuestras bolsas de algodón orgánico son fabricadas en Chile y están disponibles en todas nuestras tiendas. Firmes y cómodas, son perfectas para usarlas en todo momento y lugar.<\/p><p>Llévate nuestra bolsa de edición limitada e ilustrada por nuestro amigo y colaborador Joaquín Rosas por $2.990 o gratis por compras sobre $60.000.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"b0e9f804-5e64-4a75-bc7f-78756d1933f8":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BOLSA_TELA.webp","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["da845415-d463-490d-88a5-41644a90748d","b0e9f804-5e64-4a75-bc7f-78756d1933f8"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_third","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"74f18360-1569-4ea0-affd-f208e01c60b8":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"a9ab5ad8-c275-46d9-a9cd-093003494d22":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Elige nuestra bolsa reutilizable y llévala contigo a todas partes :)<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":6,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["a9ab5ad8-c275-46d9-a9cd-093003494d22"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["main","9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5","b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c","9cdc6a1f-879f-455f-9bff-e052882be2cf","5145f454-0a4e-4f1d-8d86-a6540493deff","6e57cd6e-dc2c-49d8-94ec-b9bba1c8a53c","f3bd1fad-2688-4827-a97b-25006255454b","74f18360-1569-4ea0-affd-f208e01c60b8"]}